lent_S_Nahida_02"},"2":{"id":2,"talentId":733,"name":"薰習成就之芽","description":"<color=#FFD780FF>所聞遍計</color>的技能等級提高3級。\\n至多提升至15級。","descriptionBuff":null,"extraData":{"addTalentExtraLevel":{"talentType":"AvatarSkill","talentIndex":2,"extraLevel":3}},"icon":"UI_Talent_U_Nahida_01"},"3":{"id":3,"talentId":734,"name":"比量現行之莖","description":"附近處於<color=#FFD780FF>所聞遍計</color>的蘊種印狀態下的敵人數量為1/2/3/4或更多時，納西妲的元素精通提升100/120/140/160點。","descriptionBuff":null,"extraData":null,"icon":"UI_Talent_S_Nahida_03"},"4":{"id":4,"talentId":735,"name":"妙諦破愚之葉","description":"<color=#FFD780FF>心景幻成</color>的技能等級提高3級。\\n至多提升至15級。","descriptionBuff":null,"extraData":{"addTalentExtraLevel":{"talentType":"AvatarSkill","talentIndex":9,"extraLevel":3}},"icon":"UI_Talent_U_Nahida_02"},"5":{"id":5,"talentId":736,"name":"大辨圓成之實","description":"施放<color=#FFD780FF>心景幻成</color>後，納西妲的普通攻擊或重擊命中處於<color=#FFD780FF>所聞遍計</color>的蘊種印狀態下的敵人時，將對該敵人及其所處連結中的所有敵人釋放滅淨三業·業障除，基於納西妲攻擊力的200%與元素精通的400%，造成<color=#99FF88FF>草元素傷害</color>。\\n滅淨三業·業障除造成的傷害視為元素戰技傷害，每0.2秒至多觸發一次。\\n該效果至多持續10秒，將在納西妲釋放6次滅淨三業·業障除後移除。","descriptionBuff":null,"extraData":null,"icon":"UI_Talent_S_Nahida_04","advancedProps":[{"name":"Karmic Oblivion","elementalGaugeTheory":"1U","internalCooldown":{"tag":{"span":null,"text":"Nahida C6"},"type":{"span":null,"text":"2.5s/3 Hits"}},"interruptionResistance":"30","interruptionResistanceStagger":{"staggerLevel":"Light","horizontalForce":"200","verticalForce":"0"},"bluntAttack":false}]}},"dictionary":null}}